{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/extras/oneironaut_headline7.png?t=1744384642\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, slide, grind and parkour your way through an ever changing dreamscape where you\u2019ll never run through the same level twice.  Experience psychedelic worlds in this relaxing, yet action filled gameplay with an ambient soundtrack, and SFX by Swedish DJ and Producer Henrik B.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/extras/kortkort.gif?t=1744384642\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/extras/oneironaut_headline8.png?t=1744384642\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All art in the game is real! We have collaborated with an artist to transport real paintings and clay sculptures straight into the Oneironaut world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/extras/Bana6_kortkort.gif?t=1744384642\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/extras/oneironaut_headline6.png?t=1744384642\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Avoid or destroy an array of surprising (and sometimes frustrating) traps and enemies as you race towards the finish line!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/extras/itsatrap.gif?t=1744384642\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/extras/oneironaut_headline5.png?t=1744384642\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parkour </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Freerunning </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Scoring System </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Trick Challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Multiple Maps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Third and Cinematic Camera </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ragdoll/Bail Button </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Pause menu </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Original in-game Music </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> etheral elements (Art &amp; atmospheric music in combination)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3034550?t=1744384642","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744384642","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/f8cad1cc20fc35933752425f60e61825c88b697a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744384642","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/f8cad1cc20fc35933752425f60e61825c88b697a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744384642","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3194210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034550/extras/oneironaut_headline7.png?t=1744384642\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, slide, grind and parkour your way through an ever changing dreamscape where you\